  "ingredients": [
    "2 cup almond flour",
    "1/3 cup unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1/3 cup low-carb chocolate protein powder",
    "2 1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "1/2 cup butter (softened)",
    "2/3 cup allulose",
    "1 cup ricotta cheese (room temperature)",
    "3 large egg (room temperature)",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 cup unsweetened almond milk",
    "1/2 cup unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1/2 cup allulose",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened almond milk",
    "2 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients. Pre-heat oven to 325F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, whisk together the almond flour, cocoa powder, protein powder, baking powder, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, beat the butter with the allulose until creamy and light, about 2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in the ricotta until well combined. Then, add the eggs, one at a time, beating after each addition and scraping down the sides of the bowl as needed. Lastly, beat in the vanilla extract.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the dry ingredients into the wet slowly, beating until just combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the batter into a prepared bundt pan and smooth the top. Bake for 40-50 minutes or until it has risen and top is just firm to the touch. Allow cake to cool in the pan for 20 minutes, then flip out onto a wire rack or cake platter to cool completely.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan over medium heat, combine the ingredients for the glaze. Bring mixture to a simmer, stirring, until slightly thickened. Remove from heat and let cool, then slowly pour over the cake.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Keto-Chocolate-Ricotta-Cake-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep on the counter for up to 4 days or in the fridge for up to a week. Cover in plastic wrap or store in a container to help from drying out. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-ricotta-cake/#wprm-recipe-57833-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
